  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from Exhibit B (p2) Total Governmental Funds column. Beginning fund balance is printed as 'beginning of year (restated)' 2,550,719 (p3; p1 net position beginning (restated) 2,550,719); no restatement amount or prior balance is printed in the trimmed report, so it is recorded as printed with no adjustment. Roll-forward 2,550,719 + 4,539,436 - 3,749,506 = 3,340,649. Cash: Cash and cash equivalents 3,340,649 on Exhibit A (p1); beginning cash not printed. Taxes 2,477,095 split from the p1 general receipts (property 2,109,777 + inheritance 367,318, exact). Transfers 565,000 eliminated in the Total column; recorded from the fund columns. Balance sheet: fund balance classes from the p3 governmental funds statement (no asset line printed there) and the asset line from p1; totals equal. Detail: General, Road and Bridge, Inheritance and ARP budget schedules (pp5-11) and nonmajor combining schedule (p4) per fund column; budget lines with no actual amount not recorded. Transfer cross-check: General out 565,000 = Road and Bridge in 565,000. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
